# App providers

Follow `doc/app-providers.md`.

- Wrap the app in `AppProviders` from `src/providers`.
- Keep provider order: Gesture → SafeArea → Account → Social → Theme; pass `localDataReady`.
- Add new app-wide providers inside that file (prefer documenting in `doc/app-providers.md`).
- Do not put `SafeAreaView` / screen backgrounds in `AppProviders` — use `ScreenLayout` per screen.
